app/src/styles.css
app/src-tauri/gen/android/**/build/
app/src-tauri/gen/android/.gradle/
app/src-tauri/gen/apple/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/
target/

# Staged into the app bundle by `cargo xtask bundle`, not authored here.
app/src-tauri/speech/
app/src-tauri/binaries/

# Signing keys, never. An Android keystore cannot be rotated after an app is
# published — the certificate *is* the app's identity to Play and to the
# on-device installer — so a committed one is not a leak you clean up, it is
# the end of the update path for every install. `keystore.properties` is
# already covered by Tauri's generated ignore file under `gen/android/`; the
# keystore itself was covered by nothing, and `docs/signing-android.md` tells
# you to put one in a directory that is otherwise tracked. This is here at
# the root rather than in the generated file so regenerating the Android
# project cannot quietly take it away.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12

# Flatpak build output. `build-dir/` is 160MB and is invisible today only
# because `flatpak build-init` writes its own `.gitignore` containing `*`
# inside it — an ignore rule this repository does not own and did not ask
# for. `repo/` and `*.flatpak` are created by `release.yml` and were covered
# by nothing at all.
packaging/flatpak/build-dir/
packaging/flatpak/repo/
.flatpak-builder/
*.flatpak

# Never committed, and named here rather than assumed. Nothing reads a `.env`
# in this project today; the entry exists so that the day something does, the
# file is already ignored rather than ignored afterwards.
.env
